    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/aa04c61c1eaf95e2da9b2ae75c0fc657.webp?t=1753232560\" /></div><br><strong>Tackle cases that will each take place in a different part of the world. Find clues to aid you on your mission to solve these cases. Once the case has been solved, you\u2019ll be tasked with having to deal with whatever creature is responsible.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/bd4db557c23a1c03aa92ce76e3c119f0.poster.avif?t=1753232560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/bd4db557c23a1c03aa92ce76e3c119f0.webm?t=1753232560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/bd4db557c23a1c03aa92ce76e3c119f0.mp4?t=1753232560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/9b5d9276d3b1189df299e79706a4e731.webp?t=1753232560\" /></div><br><strong>Use the knowledge gained from your cases to capture these ferocious cryptids. Traps and other weapons can be used to subdue the creature, once secured, they will be displayed back at your FOB.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/79138fccbce56ba734d5ce1b94318131.poster.avif?t=1753232560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/79138fccbce56ba734d5ce1b94318131.webm?t=1753232560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/79138fccbce56ba734d5ce1b94318131.mp4?t=1753232560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/dc10f49be4748a90a85efa3dfb27f6e0.webp?t=1753232560\" /></div><br><strong>Use vehicles to quickly traverse large areas and to escape pursuing cryptids. Be wary when driving though, hitting something while moving too fast can result in you being thrown off your bike, allowing the monster time to catch up.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/7dcc738c509b50f1dd726d22068ce122.poster.avif?t=1753232560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/7dcc738c509b50f1dd726d22068ce122.webm?t=1753232560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/7dcc738c509b50f1dd726d22068ce122.mp4?t=1753232560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/a9cadae75451f11e63dfe47637e4b64d.webp?t=1753232560\" /></div><br><strong>Freely Customize your hunter\u2019s hair, tops, bottoms, bags, shoes, and much more.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/414cb110d0a8766b8d55cda4e3dd989c.poster.avif?t=1753232560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/414cb110d0a8766b8d55cda4e3dd989c.webm?t=1753232560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/414cb110d0a8766b8d55cda4e3dd989c.mp4?t=1753232560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/44b5c995949929ea951dd0cc8d86f4be.webp?t=1753232560\" /></div><br><strong>Play with up to 3 other Hunters. It\u2019ll be much easier to secure the more aggressive monsters with some friends.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/c1b1d5d0b693949268a9f8b2cfcd88d4.poster.avif?t=1753232560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/c1b1d5d0b693949268a9f8b2cfcd88d4.webm?t=1753232560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547670/extras/c1b1d5d0b693949268a9f8b2cfcd88d4.mp4?t=1753232560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
